   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:01245",
   "off": 4677,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  五日前 あたしが森から\r  町に帰ろうとした時だった",
   "en": "It was five days ago, when I was headin' back to town from the woods.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:0127d",
   "off": 4733,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:01280",
   "off": 4736,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  突然 物凄い音がして\r  あたりが真っ暗になって\r  ね",
   "en": "All of a sudden there was this terrible noise, and everything went black, dearie.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:012b9",
   "off": 4793,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:012bc",
   "off": 4796,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  もどって見たら 町が\r  なくなっているじゃないか",
   "en": "When I came back to look, the town was just gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:012f2",
   "off": 4850,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:012f5",
   "off": 4853,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  それ以来 こうして\r  怪我人の看病をしてるの\r  さ",
   "en": "Ever since, I've been here like this, tendin' the wounded.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:0132c",
   "off": 4908,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:01333",
   "off": 4915,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  あたしにゃ\r  身よりもないしねぇ",
   "en": "Got no family of my own, y'see.",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:0135a",
   "off": 4954,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "\b",
   "en": "",
   "kind": "data",
   "status": "",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "EVENT07:0135d",
   "off": 4957,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  他にも怪我人をみつけた\r  ら ここにつれておいで」",
   "en": "If you find any more wounded, bring 'em here.\"",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
